doc:sec-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6 Definition of information officers" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Each of the following is an information officer: (a) the Information Commissioner; (b) the Freedom of Information Commissioner; (c) the Privacy Commissioner.   Office of the Australian Information Commissioner  Part 2 Functions and powers of the information officers  Division 3 Section 7 Australian Information Commissioner Act 2010 Compilation date: 11/12/2024" ;
