concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 Definition of information commissioner functions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "The information commissioner functions are as follows: (a) to report to the Minister on any matter that relates to the Commonwealth Government’s policy and practice with respect to: (i) the collection, use, disclosure, management, administration or storage of, or accessibility to, information held by the Government; and (ii) the systems used, or proposed to be used, for the activities covered by subparagraph (i); (b) any other function conferred by this Act or another Act (or an instrument under this Act or another Act) on the Information Commissioner other than a freedom of information function or a privacy function." ;
    skos:definition "The information commissioner functions are as follows: (a) to report to the Minister on any matter that relates to the Commonwealth Government’s policy and practice with respect to: (i) the collection, use, disclosure, management, administration or storage of, or accessibility to, information held by the Government; and (ii) the systems used, or proposed to be used, for the activities covered by subparagraph (i); (b) any other function conferred by this Act or another Act (or an instrument under this Act or another Act) on the Information Commissioner other than a freedom of information function or a privacy function."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8784df7f2e46ae0cf6501aac693df5cdcdfef7cb2ce78b3fc989e014916515c7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "11"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Report on Commonwealth Government's policy and practice regarding information collection, use, disclosure, management, administration, or storage." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-information-commissioner-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-information-commissioner-act-2010.pdf, p.11" ;
    cml:asserts concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-7-norm .
