concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Definition of privacy functions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The privacy functions are functions conferred on the Information Commissioner by an Act (or an instrument under an Act), if: (a) the functions: (i) relate to the privacy of an individual; and (ii) are not freedom of information functions; or (b) the functions are conferred by: (i) Part IVD (about the consumer data right) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or (ii) an instrument made under that Part; or (iii) another Act because of that Part.   Office of the Australian Information Commissioner  Part 2 Functions and powers of the information officers  Division 3 Section 10 Australian Information Commissioner Act 2010 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (2) The functions mentioned in subsection (1) include, but are not limited to, the provisions in the following table. Provisions that confer privacy functions Item Legislation Provision Privacy Act 1988 Division 2 of Part IV Crimes Act 1914 Division 5 of Part VIIC Data-matching Program (Assistance and Tax) Act 1990 Sections 12 to 14 National Health Act 1953 Section 135AA Telecommunications Act 1997 Section 309" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The privacy functions are functions conferred on the Information Commissioner by an Act (or an instrument under an Act), if: (a) the functions: (i) relate to the privacy of an individual; and (ii) are not freedom of information functions; or (b) the functions are conferred by: (i) Part IVD (about the consumer data right) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or (ii) an instrument made under that Part; or (iii) another Act because of that Part.   Office of the Australian Information Commissioner  Part 2 Functions and powers of the information officers  Division 3 Section 10 Australian Information Commissioner Act 2010 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (2) The functions mentioned in subsection (1) include, but are not limited to, the provisions in the following table. Provisions that confer privacy functions Item Legislation Provision Privacy Act 1988 Division 2 of Part IV Crimes Act 1914 Division 5 of Part VIIC Data-matching Program (Assistance and Tax) Act 1990 Sections 12 to 14 National Health Act 1953 Section 135AA Telecommunications Act 1997 Section 309"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4866b614aaa509b5479c907208c53de73172f4c0027a867bc842d75890fc1062" ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-9-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-9-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
