    cof:title "9(2) Definition of privacy functions" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The functions mentioned in subsection (1) include, but are not limited to, the provisions in the following table. Provisions that confer privacy functions Item Legislation Provision Privacy Act 1988 Division 2 of Part IV Crimes Act 1914 Division 5 of Part VIIC Data-matching Program (Assistance and Tax) Act 1990 Sections 12 to 14 National Health Act 1953 Section 135AA Telecommunications Act 1997 Section 309" ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 Functions and powers of the Information Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Information Commissioner has the following functions: (a) the information commissioner functions; (b) the freedom of information functions; (c) the privacy functions. (2) The Information Commissioner has power to do all things necessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with the performance of functions conferred by this section." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Information Commissioner has the following functions: (a) the information commissioner functions; (b) the freedom of information functions; (c) the privacy functions. (2) The Information Commissioner has power to do all things necessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with the performance of functions conferred by this section."@en ;
