    skos:prefLabel "11 Functions and powers of the Freedom of Information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-11-2 ;
    values:originalText "Commissioner (1) The Freedom of Information Commissioner has the freedom of information functions. (2) The Freedom of Information Commissioner may also perform the privacy functions. (3) The Freedom of Information Commissioner has power to do all things necessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with the performance of functions conferred by this section." ;
