doc:sec-12-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "12(3) Functions and powers of the Privacy Commissioner" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Privacy Commissioner has power to do all things necessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with the performance of functions conferred by this section.   Office of the Australian Information Commissioner  Part 2 Functions and powers of the information officers  Division 3 Section 12 Australian Information Commissioner Act 2010 Compilation date: 11/12/2024" ;
