concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-12-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12(5) Functions and powers of the Privacy Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-12-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the Privacy Commissioner performs a function, or exercises a power, expressed by an Act (or an instrument under an Act) to be conferred on the Information Commissioner: (a) the Privacy Commissioner must perform the function or exercise the power upon his or her own belief or state of mind (to the extent that the performance or exercise is dependent on the belief or state of mind of the Information Commissioner); and (b) the function or power is taken to have been performed or exercised by the Information Commissioner; and (c) neither the Information Commissioner, nor the Freedom of Information Commissioner, is prevented from performing the" ;
    skos:definition "(5) If the Privacy Commissioner performs a function, or exercises a power, expressed by an Act (or an instrument under an Act) to be conferred on the Information Commissioner: (a) the Privacy Commissioner must perform the function or exercise the power upon his or her own belief or state of mind (to the extent that the performance or exercise is dependent on the belief or state of mind of the Information Commissioner); and (b) the function or power is taken to have been performed or exercised by the Information Commissioner; and (c) neither the Information Commissioner, nor the Freedom of Information Commissioner, is prevented from performing the"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4c05de6fd2d1f4765079d8a912595f076e357a2b43bda380abd1ff02428ac5db" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-12 ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must perform function or exercise power upon own belief or state of mind." ;
