concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 General terms and conditions of appointment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An information officer holds office for the period specified in the information officer’s instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 5 years. (2) An information officer holds office on a full-time basis.   Appointments and staffing for the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner" ;
