concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-22 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22 Disclosure of interests"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-22 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A disclosure by an information officer under section 29 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 (which deals with the duty to disclose interests) must be made to the Minister. (2) Subsection (1) applies in addition to any rules made for the purposes of that section. (3) For the purposes of this Act and the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013, the information officer is taken not to have complied with section 29 of that Act if he or she does not comply with subsection (1) of this section." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A disclosure by an information officer under section 29 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 (which deals with the duty to disclose interests) must be made to the Minister. (2) Subsection (1) applies in addition to any rules made for the purposes of that section. (3) For the purposes of this Act and the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013, the information officer is taken not to have complied with section 29 of that Act if he or she does not comply with subsection (1) of this section."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cb96bbb1416341db2ad23cc8623496dca2daa65415093aab8103d52117a6db05" ;
    cof:pageNumber "21"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-22-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-22-ss-2 ;
