    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of this Act and the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013, the information officer is taken not to have complied with section 29 of that Act if he or she does not comply with subsection (1) of this section." ;
    cof:pageNumber "21"^^xsd:integer .

