    cml:modality cml:LTL ;
    cml:operator "Allows" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Enables conditional access based on multiple document requests." ;
    cml:premiseText "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), and for the purposes of that subsection, partial access is granted in respect of a request:" ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::temporal_ltl" ;
    cml:confidence "0.5000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-31-2-ss-3 cml:asserts concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-31-2-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-4 .
concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-31-2-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-4 a cml:LogicApplication ;
    cml:modality cml:AllenInterval ;
    cml:operator "Between" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Defines temporal interval for partial access." ;
    cml:premiseText "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), and for the purposes of that subsection, partial access is granted in respect of a request:" ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
    cml:confidence "0.5000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sec-31-2-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "31(3) Definition of the freedom of information matters" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), and for the purposes of that subsection, partial access is granted in respect of a request if either or both of the following conditions are satisfied in relation to the request: (a) access was granted to an edited copy (within the meaning of section 22 of the Freedom of Information Act 1982) of the document (or any of the documents) requested; (b) the request related to 2 or more documents and access was refused to one or more of the documents." ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-32 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32 Definition of the privacy matters"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The privacy matters are as follows: (a) a statement of the performance during the year of the privacy functions conferred by section 17 and paragraph 28A(1)(d) of the Privacy Act 1988; (b) a statement about the operation of registered APP codes under the Privacy Act 1988 that contain procedures covered by subsection (2), including details about the number of complaints made during the year under codes, their nature and outcome; (c) a statement including details about the number of complaints made under section 36 of the Privacy Act 1988 during the year; (d) a statement including details about the number of complaints made under section 36 of the Privacy Act 1988 in relation to which the Commissioner has decided during the year under section 41 of that Act not to investigate, or not to investigate further, and the relevant grounds for the decision. (2) This subsection covers procedures for making and dealing with complaints in relation to acts or practices that may be an interference with the privacy of an individual." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The privacy matters are as follows: (a) a statement of the performance during the year of the privacy functions conferred by section 17 and paragraph 28A(1)(d) of the Privacy Act 1988; (b) a statement about the operation of registered APP codes under the Privacy Act 1988 that contain procedures covered by subsection (2), including details about the number of complaints made during the year under codes, their nature and outcome; (c) a statement including details about the number of complaints made under section 36 of the Privacy Act 1988 during the year; (d) a statement including details about the number of complaints made under section 36 of the Privacy Act 1988 in relation to which the Commissioner has decided during the year under section 41 of that Act not to investigate, or not to investigate further, and the relevant grounds for the decision. (2) This subsection covers procedures for making and dealing with complaints in relation to acts or practices that may be an interference with the privacy of an individual."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fecd1ccb081e8a8ed2aed98e033da5dc1800e02763436e7d7bee153cd8386134" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-32-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-32-ss-2 ;
