concept:australian-information-commissioner-act-2010-sec-33 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33 Review of operation of Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-33 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must cause a review of the operation of this Act to be undertaken. (2) The review must: (a) start 2 years after the commencement of this section; and (b) be completed within 6 months.   Miscellaneous  Part 5  Section 34 Australian Information Commissioner Act 2010 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (3) The Minister must cause a written report about the review to be prepared. (4) The Minister must cause a copy of the report to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the Minister receives the report." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must cause a review of the operation of this Act to be undertaken. (2) The review must: (a) start 2 years after the commencement of this section; and (b) be completed within 6 months.   Miscellaneous  Part 5  Section 34 Australian Information Commissioner Act 2010 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (3) The Minister must cause a written report about the review to be prepared. (4) The Minister must cause a copy of the report to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the Minister receives the report."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8b1c62536acb133168145e2a3088449435e43edd385caf3da05f5c0c994c1314" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer ;
